  "storyPlan": {
    "premise": "What is an AI agent, explained simply for people who are not technical. A chatbot only answers; an agent gets a goal and works step by step: it picks a tool, uses it, checks the result and moves on. Use my app TikMaker as the example: its agent picks a template, writes hooks, writes the script and lays out the scenes, and plain code checks every answer. Think of it as a new employee with a menu and a strict manager."
